            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omuri ebyo ebi twagamba, ekirikukira obukuru nikyo eki. Twine Omunyamurwa omukuru nk'ogwo, oshutami aha rubaju rwa buryo orw'ekitebe ky'obukama obw'Ow'ekitiinisa omu iguru, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "orikuheerereza Aharikwera omu Ihema ery'amazima, eritarateirwe bantu, kureka eryateirwe Mukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimumanya ngu omunyamurwa omukuru weena ateebwaho okuhonga empongano n'okutamba ebitambo; n'ahabw'ekyo nawe ashemereiree kugira eky'okuhonga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuri yaabaire ari omu nsi, takubaire munyamurwa na kakye, ahakuba hariho abanyamurwa abashangwa bahonga empongano, nk'oku kiragiirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 25:40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi ebyo ebi bakora n'enshusha kandi n'ebishushani by'eby'omu iguru; ahakuba Musa ku yaabaire naayenda kuteera eihema, akahaburwa Ruhanga owaamugizire ati: Oteho omutima, okore byona, noobishushanisa nk'ebi waareebire aha rushozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.3.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kor 3:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka hati Kristo ahairwe obuheereza oburikukira obwa ira oburungi, ahabw'okuba We n'omuteerani w'endagaano erikukira oburungi, ahakuba neehamibwa ebyaraganisiibwe ebirikukira ebya ira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endagaano ey'okubanza kuri yaabaire etaine kishobiremu, tihaakwetengirwe ndiijo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
